      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MONARO MUSCLE (1) goes very well this trip starting five times for two wins and two minors. Comes off a (19.83) win last time, scoring by 0.8 lengths in a Maiden over 366m at this track. Looks suited and should go close. BOSSY WITCH (2) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at Q Straight over 300m (17.02). Returns to favourable track. Key runner on best form. JUNGLE GIRL (3) recorded her 1st career win last time out (20.34) at this track and drawn box 3 for the first time here. Sure to measure up. BEETLE BOO (7) was a surprise last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
